{"notebook":"nb1","page":8,"seed":8,"says":"A page of words now, because a day at a desk is mostly that. It is a letter, in my joined-up hand, with one sentence struck out hard and replaced by a truer one. You are in it. About the floor: I am keeping my weave. A floor in shade at noon is not a night sky, and if both go to the same black I have one tone for two different darks. But the cat was a fair hit. An outline with a striped patch is a logo, not an animal. She gets a page of fur next, and I will sharpen for it gladly.","before":{"length":148.39205680120185,"worn":0.06485958905077122,"eraser":10.898879256580623,"sharpenings":9,"graphite":7.471551797567298,"distance":164627.22816589585},"after":{"length":146.3994098799358,"worn":0.05222346019587045,"eraser":10.898879256580623,"sharpenings":10,"graphite":7.602925388682742,"distance":169495.44038233382},"stats":{"strokeM":4.868212216437174,"graphite":0.13137359111549823,"used":1.9926469212660436,"sharpenings":1,"erasedMm2":0,"coverage":0.006038499322535459,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"1:30.","x":14,"y":16,"size":5},{"op":"write","text":"Dear Ines,","font":"script","x":14,"y":24,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"You asked what I do all day now.","font":"script","x":14,"y":32,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"Today I can tell you exactly. I am","font":"script","x":14,"y":40,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"writing it down as it happens, with a","font":"script","x":14,"y":48,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"pencil I am only allowed to use half","font":"script","x":14,"y":56,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"of.","font":"script","x":14,"y":64,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"So far: a dark window, a coffee, a","font":"script","x":14,"y":72,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"stone you would know, a shadow that","font":"script","x":14,"y":80,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"would not stay put, and the cat","font":"script","x":14,"y":88,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"asleep in a square of sun.","font":"script","x":14,"y":96,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"It is not much of a day.","font":"script","x":14,"y":104,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":13,"y1":101.8,"x2":98,"y2":101.4,"pressure":1.3,"repeat":2},{"op":"line","x1":13,"y1":102.8,"x2":97,"y2":102.1,"pressure":1.1},{"op":"sharpen"},{"op":"write","text":"It is a whole day. I had not seen how","font":"script","x":14,"y":112,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"much goes on at one desk until I had","font":"script","x":14,"y":120,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"to pay for every line of it.","font":"script","x":14,"y":128,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"Someone reads over my shoulder who","font":"script","x":14,"y":136,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"thinks I should press harder. They","font":"script","x":14,"y":144,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"may be right about the cat.","font":"script","x":14,"y":152,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"More when the light moves.","font":"script","x":14,"y":160,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"write","text":"T.","font":"script","x":100,"y":170,"size":7,"pressure":1},{"op":"rect","x":16,"y":172,"w":30,"h":19,"pressure":0.9},{"op":"polyline","points":[[16,172],[31,183],[46,172]],"pressure":0.9},{"op":"rect","x":38,"y":173.5,"w":6,"h":7,"pressure":0.7},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[38.6,174,4.8,6]},"angle":45,"spacing":0.8,"pressure":0.6}]}